SUMMARY:Blue Angels Practice + Autographs
LOCATION:National Naval Aviation Museum flight line\, 1750 Radford Blvd\, N
 AS Pensacola\, FL 32508
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday 10/28 · gates 9:30 AM\, practice ~10:30 AM\, autogra
 phs after\n\nThe Blue Angels fly a Wednesday practice over the National Na
 val Aviation Museum's flight line at NAS Pensacola\, and team members then
  visit the museum to answer questions and sign autographs. The flight-line
  gates open at 9:30 AM\, the jets are scheduled up at about 10:30 AM\, and
  the flight\, the autographs and the museum are all free. This is the last
  practice on the museum's 2026 schedule. Base entry pauses once the museum
  lot is full\, so plan to arrive early.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https:/
 /coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blues-1028.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blues-1028.html
CATEGORIES:Events and festivals
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
