 nsacola turns the Barkley House into a monster party where a famous monste
 r hunter crashes the guest list and the diners have to find the killer. IC
 MT Murder Mystery Theatre performs the show\, and the ticket covers a them
 ed dinner\, beer and wine. Guests are invited to dress as a classic monste
 r for a costume contest. The evening supports the UWF Historic Trust and i
 s for guests 21 and older.\n\nPrice: from $65\n\nDetails: https://coastale
 ventures.com/events/ev-hp-monsters-ball-1028.html
