 art and Bizet program to the public on the afternoon of the evening concer
 t. Many pieces are played in full and some sections are stopped and retouc
 hed\, so it is a look at how a concert is finished. The program is Stravin
 sky's Pulcinella Suite\, Mozart's Piano Concerto No. 24 with Carter Johnso
 n and Bizet's Symphony in C\, conducted by Peter Rubardt.\n\nPrice: from $
