  to bring enslaved Africans into the United States\, which rests in the Mo
 bile River north of the city. The excursion is guided by Africa Town Freed
 om Tours\, a group of descendants of Clotilda passengers\, storytellers an
 d community leaders in Africatown. Guides cover the voyage\, the passenger
 s' lives and the legacy that followed.\n\nPrice: from $27\n\nDetails: http
