 n St\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday 11/10 · 7:00 PM to 8:00 PM\n\nThe Pensacola Archaeolog
 ical Society holds its monthly membership lecture in the classroom at the 
 Florida Public Archaeology Network in downtown Pensacola. The November tal
 k covers why collections kept for decades are hard to reach and wearing do
 wn. It also covers how a 1970s collection is handled at UWF under current 
 curation practice and new federal repatriation regulations. Free parking a
 nd light refreshments are listed.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails:
