 bile\, AL 36608
DESCRIPTION:Saturdays · 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM\n\nThe Monte L. Moorer/Spring H
 ill Branch Library runs a chess club open to beginners and experienced pla
 yers alike. The library says the program suits ages 6 and up\, including t
 eens\, and it emphasizes concentration and problem solving over competitio
