 s earn league points toward monthly prizes and a promo card the first time
  they play each month\, and you can borrow a deck or buy one. The shop des
 cribes it as great for families. Casual play is free\, tournaments vary in
  price\, and a free Carde.io account is needed to earn promos.\n\nPrice: F
 ree\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-disney-lorcana-leag
 ue-1010.html
