  AM. The first 300 registrants get a packet with a shirt and merchandise\,
  4-mile winners get water bottles by age and gender\, and the first 100 fu
 n runners get medals. Free food and drinks follow\, and it benefits the Se
 cret Santa program for local families.\n\nPrice: from $25\n\nDetails: http
 s://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-flora-bama-make-it-to-the-line-4-m-1226
